  "ingredients": [
    "4 pounds potatoes, peeled",
    "15 slices bacon",
    "1 (16 ounce) container reduced-fat sour cream",
    "2 cups shredded Cheddar cheese",
    "2 tablespoons mayonnaise",
    "2 tablespoons dried chives",
    "1 teaspoon salt",
    "1 teaspoon ground black pepper"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/dCw7TgoqrOOi6HjSmCUMykfvUis=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-215624-baked-potato-salad-ddmfs-step1-3x4-41f3ca6647144238ab25063ea949d02c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/215624/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place potatoes into a large pot and cover with salted water; bring to a boil over high heat. Reduce the heat to medium-low and simmer until just tender, about 15 minutes. Drain and set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/jWF8rirybh_SFSiC9mhoncPys3c=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-215624-baked-potato-salad-ddmfs-step2-3x4-efd539bd7a964c719a7d0e230fec653a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/215624/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook bacon in a large, deep skillet over medium-high heat, turning occasionally, until evenly browned, about 10 minutes. Drain on a paper towel-lined plate.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/rmosGshUWhxwt0RL1DmVWnpF-8w=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-215624-baked-potato-salad-ddmfs-step3-3x4-ef48667468d24559918877afcad9a97d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/215624/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dice cooled potatoes and place into a large bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/vvCNJPmm4JRdeqLR60yPvEw9_Gc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-215624-baked-potato-salad-ddmfs-step4-3x4-d81271b55c524b6cba7493b4c458ab7e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/215624/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add sour cream, Cheddar, mayonnaise, chives, salt, and pepper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/_JXTGaaWrcB6IxABRFW7ODjSAR4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-215624-baked-potato-salad-ddmfs-step5-3x4-bdfda21833914fca8f76059c4ea64e5f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/215624/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Crumble bacon into the bowl and mix until ingredients are well combined. Cover and refrigerate for 8 hours before serving.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/_y9Foe7d3posZvZ6fCPLYwqIWYk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-215624-baked-potato-salad-ddmfs-step6-3x4-db64d39656f243009a93152b7885160d.jpg"
